{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">大坑發生塌樹，壓毀燈柱及水管，無人受傷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方指在清晨四時許，在大坑道133號路邊一棵約30米高、20米闊的樹幹塌下，跌落一間安老院的空地上，壓毀一條燈柱及一條水管。水務署人員到場處理。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.TREE-0700_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026ksxzaXDbef1785198498.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TREE-0700_002.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-28T00:59:10.347814+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}